# UI

Colors live in `src/core/theme/tokens.ts`. Screens use the active theme.

| Token | Dark | Light |
|---|---|---|
| primary | `#F5A623` | `#F5A623` |
| background | `#121212` | `#F5F5F5` |
| surface | `#1E1E1E` | `#FFFFFF` |
| text | `#F5F5F5` | `#121212` |
| textMuted | `#9E9E9E` | `#616161` |

## Shared UI

Use `MovieCard`, `LoadingIndicator`, and `ErrorView` from `src/core/ui/`. Poster grids are two columns, aspect `0.65`. Trending row height is 220, card width 130. Detail backdrop height is 300.

## Copy

Keep roadmap strings exact, including **Sign in** (not Google) and the empty-state sentences.

## Do not

- Put hex values in screens
- Add NativeWind, a UI kit, or extra icon packages
- Build screens that are not in the roadmap
- Use swipe-to-delete
